'''Wes Vinik''' was a [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]]. During the [[High Republic Era]], he was the [[Padawan]] to [[Jedi Master]] [[Zia Zaldor Zanna]]. He owned an [[astromech droid]] named [[R0-M1]].<ref name="Heroes and Hotshots">{{YJA|Heroes and Hotshots}}</ref>

==Biography==
As a [[Jedi Youngling]], Wes Vinik trained with and became best friends with [[Celesta Kami]].<ref name="The Battle of Tenoo">{{YJA|The Battle of Tenoo}}</ref>

Around [[232 BBY]], Wes traveled on missions across [[the galaxy]] as a [[Padawan|Jedi Padawan]] including chasing a gang of [[Pirate|thieves]] stealing a [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] [[starship]] through the [[Moons of Iego]] on [[Ayoh 7]].<ref name="Heroes and Hotshots" />

He later arrived on [[Tenoo]] with his [[Jedi Master|Master]] [[Zia Zaldor Zanna]] to meet the [[Jedi Initiate|younglings]] [[Kai Brightstar]], [[Lys Solay]], and [[Nubs]].<ref name="Heroes and Hotshots" />
{{Char-stub}}

==Personality and traits==
Wes Vinik could speak [[Huttese]], which proved useful when defusing a conflict between the [[Besalisk]] [[Braygh]] and a pair of [[Dostan]] aliens.<ref name="Lost Little Droid">{{YJA|Little Lost Droid}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
Wes Vinik is a character created for ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]''. Vinik appears in [[Young Jedi Adventures Season Two|''Young Jedi Adventures'' Season Two]] where he was voiced by [[Gunnar Sizemore]].<ref name="YJA Season 2" />

